  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-shanyin-gongzhu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">景和世，山陰主就帝求吏部郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-shanyin-gongzhu:p001:m0013" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">褚淵</persName>入內侍己，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-shanyin-gongzhu:p001:m0020" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">淵</persName>見拘逼，終不肯從，與<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-shanyin-gongzhu:p001:m0031" ref="pbz_pni_tco_A">戢</persName>同居止月餘日，由是特申情好。</p>
